---
manual: art.oval.style_method
lines: [1747, 1747]
testability: api
display: any
----------- app code
Shoes.app do
  @circle = oval 10, 10, 50
end
----------- test code
circle = oval("@circle")
assert_equal 10, circle.left

circle.style(left: 40, width: 80)

assert_equal 40, circle.left, "style changed left"
assert_equal 80, circle.width, "style changed width"
assert_equal 40, circle.style[:left], "and style reads the new value back"
